  check the frozen ``.new`` copies against ``SRC_PIN_SHA256`` and
  ``SRC_MAN_SHA256``, apply the manifest, run ``verify_pin`` (whose body calls
  ``--verify-codex-pin``), die unless it exits 0 and require ``verified`` with

